{
    "title": "Hippo Home: Maintain & Insure",
    "description": "HIPPO HOME\r\nDeveloped by Hippo Home Care\r\n\r\nWelcome to Hippo Home - your partner in proactive home protection. As a homeowner, life can feel pretty hectic. We're here with personalized resources to help you crush whatever needs doing.\r\n\r\nMAKE HOME MAINTENANCE LOW MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nWith the Hippo Home app, you can:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Expand Your Coverages: Explore competitive quotes for coverages such as home, auto, flood, and pet insurance. \r\n\u2022 Take control: Improve your Home Health with actionable, personalized maintenance checklists and DIY guides.\r\n\u2022 Speak with experts: Help avoid and minimize repair costs with Hippo Home Assist - a home maintenance and repair concierge available 24/7.\r\n\u2022 Save money: Save up to hundreds of dollars on products from top brands across home security, energy optimization, and more.\r\n\r\nFor customers who have insurance policies with Hippo:\r\n\r\n\u2022 View or manage your policy, coverage details, and easily review documents\r\n\u2022 Contact Hippo's customer service team directly\r\n\r\nHippo Insurance Services (\"Hippo\") is a general agent for affiliated and non-affiliated insurance companies. Hippo is licensed as a property casualty insurance agency in all states in which products are offered. Coverage subject to underwriting qualifications. Not available in all jurisdictions. For more information and state licenses, visit hippo.com.\r\n\r\nHippo Home Care (\u201cHippo Home\u201d) is an affiliate of Hippo Insurance Services. Hippo Home or its contractors would provide services. Your use of Hippo Home is subject to Hippo Home's terms of use and privacy policies. Hippo Insurance Services is not responsible for your use/non-use of Hippo Home.",
    "descriptionHTML": "HIPPO HOME<br>Developed by Hippo Home Care<br><br>Welcome to Hippo Home - your partner in proactive home protection. As a homeowner, life can feel pretty hectic. We&#39;re here with personalized resources to help you crush whatever needs doing.<br><br>MAKE HOME MAINTENANCE LOW MAINTENANCE<br><br>With the Hippo Home app, you can:<br><br>\u2022 Expand Your Coverages: Explore competitive quotes for coverages such as home, auto, flood, and pet insurance. <br>\u2022 Take control: Improve your Home Health with actionable, personalized maintenance checklists and DIY guides.<br>\u2022 Speak with experts: Help avoid and minimize repair costs with Hippo Home Assist - a home maintenance and repair concierge available 24/7.<br>\u2022 Save money: Save up to hundreds of dollars on products from top brands across home security, energy optimization, and more.<br><br>For customers who have insurance policies with Hippo:<br><br>\u2022 View or manage your policy, coverage details, and easily review documents<br>\u2022 Contact Hippo&#39;s customer service team directly<br><br>Hippo Insurance Services (&quot;Hippo&quot;) is a general agent for affiliated and non-affiliated insurance companies. Hippo is licensed as a property casualty insurance agency in all states in which products are offered. Coverage subject to underwriting qualifications. Not available in all jurisdictions. For more information and state licenses, visit hippo.com.<br><br>Hippo Home Care (\u201cHippo Home\u201d) is an affiliate of Hippo Insurance Services. Hippo Home or its contractors would provide services. Your use of Hippo Home is subject to Hippo Home&#39;s terms of use and privacy policies. Hippo Insurance Services is not responsible for your use/non-use of Hippo Home.",
